fluorine-desktop (0.0.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Ship the Hyprland 0.55 native Lua configuration with AMOLED design tokens.
  * Ship Waybar, Kitty, Fuzzel, and SwayNotificationCenter themes.
  * Ship hypridle and hyprlock OLED burn-in protection.
  * Ship the flr-shot, flr-keys, and flr-doctor command line utilities.

 -- gowthvm <gowthamgkofficial@gmail.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
